Package: sortmedia
Version: 0.1.1-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Mikal Furyto <mfuryto@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-tomli, python3-pil, libimage-exiftool-perl
Description: Sort photos and videos using recording metadata
 Sortmedia reads recording dates from EXIF and video metadata and sorts media
 into directory-local configurable structures. It preserves embedded metadata,
 keeps RAW, sidecar, and Live Photo companions together, detects exact and
 visual duplicates, and records operations for hash-verified undo. Jobs use
 hidden TOML files and are safely previewed before files are copied or moved.
